WEBVTT

01:40.180 --> 01:44.800
=Love Story in the 1970s=

01:45.322 --> 01:47.960
=Episode 26=

01:50.269 --> 01:51.070
Mr. Yuan,

01:52.150 --> 01:55.150
I actually think this draft
turned out pretty well.

01:55.271 --> 01:56.180
What do you think?

01:57.549 --> 01:59.189
This romantic style

01:59.350 --> 02:00.430
is over the top

02:01.350 --> 02:02.590
and impressionistic.

02:02.790 --> 02:03.870
Readers won't like it.

02:05.109 --> 02:05.669
Fang,

02:05.909 --> 02:09.030
you might want to lean
more toward realism.

02:09.470 --> 02:10.910
I published two comics last year.

02:10.910 --> 02:11.950
You can refer to that.

02:12.230 --> 02:13.230
Follow that style.

02:15.510 --> 02:16.950
Alright, Mr. Yuan.

02:24.350 --> 02:28.030
Yang, the draft does need
some revisions,

02:28.630 --> 02:29.910
but don't worry.

02:30.137 --> 02:31.848
It won't affect your full-time position.

02:36.135 --> 02:37.460
I have a different opinion.

02:41.293 --> 02:42.293
Why are you here?

02:42.872 --> 02:43.852
You are?

02:44.589 --> 02:45.470
This is my wife,

02:46.109 --> 02:46.869
Fei Ni.

02:47.149 --> 02:49.429
I'm also a comic reader.

02:50.030 --> 02:50.630
Mr. Fu.

02:51.030 --> 02:51.910
Mr. Yuan.

02:53.350 --> 02:55.269
I really like Fang Muyang's style.

02:55.589 --> 02:57.589
When it was serialized in the newspaper,

02:57.709 --> 03:00.190
it was very popular with readers.

03:00.829 --> 03:01.630
Young lady,

03:02.429 --> 03:04.070
newspaper serialization is one thing.

03:04.230 --> 03:05.989
Publishing a full book is another.

03:06.093 --> 03:08.182
Readers might write you
a few flattering letters,

03:08.190 --> 03:10.060
but that doesn't mean
they'll spend their money

03:10.093 --> 03:10.860
on your work.

03:11.829 --> 03:12.989
I understand that.

03:13.510 --> 03:14.350
Mr. Yuan,

03:14.709 --> 03:16.669
you're a senior in drawing comics.

03:16.869 --> 03:17.910
You're a master.

03:18.310 --> 03:20.829
We're truly grateful

03:20.910 --> 03:22.470
that you're willing to guide Muyang.

03:22.910 --> 03:24.950
I've read the revisions

03:25.230 --> 03:26.230
you suggested.

03:26.829 --> 03:28.310
They're very good.

03:28.510 --> 03:29.549
Very moving.

03:30.350 --> 03:31.910
I've also read

03:32.149 --> 03:33.389
your previous works.

03:34.589 --> 03:36.790
Most of the stories

03:37.230 --> 03:39.190
are fictional.

03:39.510 --> 03:42.109
So when you design plots and characters,

03:42.510 --> 03:45.149
the main goal is drama and conflict.

03:45.750 --> 03:48.269
But this piece is different

03:48.269 --> 03:49.429
from your previous style.

03:49.750 --> 03:51.989
It records a real disaster

03:52.149 --> 03:53.310
and an ordinary hero.

03:53.950 --> 03:57.247
The foundation of this story
is its authenticity.

03:57.910 --> 03:59.510
Sometimes I think

03:59.910 --> 04:02.470
reality itself is powerful enough.

04:02.470 --> 04:04.750
We just need to record it faithfully.

04:06.510 --> 04:07.310
However,

04:08.322 --> 04:10.972
if this story becomes fictional,

04:11.460 --> 04:13.180
if even the author
doesn't believe in it,

04:13.247 --> 04:14.527
how can he draw it

04:14.585 --> 04:16.425
with genuine emotion?

04:16.630 --> 04:18.785
And if he doesn't pour in real feeling,

04:18.997 --> 04:21.478
how can readers feel anything?

04:27.829 --> 04:29.029
Fei Ni, is it?

04:30.709 --> 04:32.029
Can you represent the readers?

04:32.389 --> 04:33.550
Can you represent the masses?

04:36.190 --> 04:37.110
I...

04:37.671 --> 04:39.226
Of course, she can't represent them.

04:40.297 --> 04:41.122
Mr. Yuan,

04:42.349 --> 04:43.709
how about we have a competition?

04:44.885 --> 04:45.965
We each draw one piece

04:46.247 --> 04:47.408
on the same subject.

04:47.709 --> 04:49.750
Let everyone vote
without knowing the authors.

04:50.585 --> 04:51.746
We'll see

04:52.626 --> 04:54.380
whose style they really prefer
in the end.

05:01.110 --> 05:02.190
Sure, we can compete.

05:02.589 --> 05:03.829
What if you lose?

05:04.004 --> 05:05.430
If I lose, I'll quit the job.

05:05.510 --> 05:06.070
Yang!

05:06.430 --> 05:08.589
You can't gamble your future like this.

05:09.149 --> 05:09.589
Fu.

05:12.510 --> 05:13.550
If I lose,

05:14.709 --> 05:15.990
we'll publish your first draft.

05:16.871 --> 05:18.310
With not a single stroke changed.

05:18.709 --> 05:19.550
Deal.

05:31.485 --> 05:33.766
I know which one is yours.

05:37.322 --> 05:37.723
Alright.

05:37.829 --> 05:38.950
Let's start the voting.

06:04.909 --> 06:06.269
These two pieces

06:06.269 --> 06:08.110
are neck and neck.

06:08.389 --> 06:10.269
It's five to four.

06:10.835 --> 06:11.797
And now,

06:11.797 --> 06:12.636
let's see

06:12.822 --> 06:15.663
who the winning piece belongs to.

06:20.060 --> 06:23.022
(Yuan)

06:48.671 --> 06:54.630
(Jiangcheng Daily)

06:55.469 --> 06:56.430
A bet is a bet.

06:59.709 --> 07:01.630
What are you going to do now?

07:02.550 --> 07:04.510
Instead of drawing things I don't like,

07:05.160 --> 07:07.315
I'd rather spend more time
with the person I like.

07:11.190 --> 07:11.750
That works.

07:12.110 --> 07:13.510
I'm on the afternoon shift today.

07:14.029 --> 07:14.990
I'll keep you company.

07:15.990 --> 07:16.310
Okay.

07:16.870 --> 07:17.469
Hop on.

07:18.349 --> 07:19.349
Let's eat something good.

07:21.870 --> 07:22.909
Hold tight, Dear.

07:36.972 --> 07:41.772
(Jiangcheng No. 1 Textile Factory)

07:48.490 --> 07:50.869
(Notice of Admission to
Work-Peasant-Soldier University:)

07:50.870 --> 07:52.982
(Zhou Xiangyang, Wang Guojun,
Fei Ni. Congratulations.)

08:17.269 --> 08:19.070
You've been going to the school
every day.

08:19.229 --> 08:20.670
Have you seen Mujing?

08:21.709 --> 08:22.310
No.

08:22.950 --> 08:23.990
Supposedly,

08:24.310 --> 08:25.630
she should be back

08:25.909 --> 08:28.229
from visiting Qu Hua's grandmother
at Jiangnan by now.

08:28.709 --> 08:32.030
Maybe we can find time to visit her.

08:32.469 --> 08:33.270
I'm busy.

08:35.030 --> 08:36.829
You haven't even started work yet.

08:36.869 --> 08:38.150
How busy can you be?

08:38.790 --> 08:39.589
As I said,

08:39.589 --> 08:40.390
I'm busy.

08:47.869 --> 08:48.509
I'm back.

08:50.709 --> 08:52.190
Why are you back so early?

08:52.589 --> 08:54.109
I quit my job at Jiangcheng Daily.

09:10.390 --> 09:11.190
Dad, Mom.

09:13.829 --> 09:16.190
Fei Ni is the only one
in our family with a job now.

09:17.430 --> 09:19.030
And she's about to go to university.

09:20.070 --> 09:21.469
Have you been informed

09:21.910 --> 09:23.349
when you'll be reinstated?

09:25.150 --> 09:26.270
I...

09:27.749 --> 09:28.869
Mine should be soon.

09:29.137 --> 09:31.550
The school has notified me
to start the paperwork procedure.

09:32.030 --> 09:33.790
Your dad's work might take longer,

09:33.790 --> 09:36.629
but they should be able to arrange
something at the Cultural Bureau.

09:38.229 --> 09:38.989
That's good.

09:54.989 --> 09:55.829
Where are you going?

09:55.960 --> 09:57.226
The Educated Youth Office.

10:05.582 --> 10:07.337
I went to the Educated Youth Office
today,

10:07.360 --> 10:08.404
and I spoke with Mr. Gao.

10:08.509 --> 10:10.349
He said he'd try to help me
sort it out.

10:10.670 --> 10:12.030
We'll have an answer in a few days.

10:12.509 --> 10:13.030
Alright.

10:13.100 --> 10:14.137
That puts my mind at ease.

10:20.629 --> 10:21.629
Let's sell it.

10:23.270 --> 10:25.229
But that was from your mom.

10:27.229 --> 10:28.790
Let's think of another way.

10:30.229 --> 10:33.070
I wanted to give it to Fei Ni,

10:34.390 --> 10:35.229
but

10:35.749 --> 10:39.190
our jobs still aren't settled.

10:39.452 --> 10:40.972
Forget her going to university,

10:40.972 --> 10:42.452
even if she didn't,

10:42.589 --> 10:43.629
the three of us

10:43.629 --> 10:45.790
can't live off our daughter-in-law.

10:50.030 --> 10:50.829
Sell it.

10:51.670 --> 10:52.469
Alright.

10:53.070 --> 10:54.150
As you say.

10:56.869 --> 10:57.589
Mom.

10:59.070 --> 10:59.670
Dad.

11:00.349 --> 11:02.469
We didn't mean to overhear.

11:03.715 --> 11:05.737
If you were planning to give me
the bracelet,

11:05.910 --> 11:06.989
you can give it to me now.

11:22.509 --> 11:23.910
It's so beautiful.

11:24.349 --> 11:25.749
I couldn't bear to sell it.

11:26.910 --> 11:27.310
But...

11:27.310 --> 11:28.109
Don't worry.

11:28.709 --> 11:29.910
We'll figure something out.

11:51.229 --> 11:51.869
Fang Muyang.

11:53.026 --> 11:53.860
Does it look good?

11:57.829 --> 11:58.430
Yes.

12:00.989 --> 12:01.989
It's just like mine.

12:02.493 --> 12:04.500
They were both passed down
from my grandmother.

12:14.271 --> 12:15.270
Why aren't you wearing?

12:16.190 --> 12:17.190
It's too precious.

12:17.190 --> 12:18.430
I want to keep it safe

12:18.709 --> 12:20.190
and pass it on.

12:20.190 --> 12:20.790
Right?

12:21.869 --> 12:22.430
Yes.

12:23.270 --> 12:24.829
We'll pass it on to our children.

12:28.150 --> 12:28.709
Fang Muyang,

12:30.185 --> 12:31.624
you heard what Mom and Dad said.

12:31.624 --> 12:33.660
Their jobs aren't settled yet.

12:34.293 --> 12:35.582
What are we going to do?

12:37.869 --> 12:39.030
Here's what I'm thinking.

12:39.709 --> 12:40.709
Starting tomorrow,

12:40.826 --> 12:42.871
I'll go to the Educated Youth Office
every day

12:42.989 --> 12:43.790
to follow up on it.

12:45.390 --> 12:48.550
Then I'll submit more pieces
to the newspaper and magazines

12:48.671 --> 12:49.915
to earn some writing fees.

12:50.030 --> 12:50.950
If the job

12:51.589 --> 12:53.070
doesn't come through soon,

12:53.448 --> 12:55.580
I can also make some furniture
to earn extra money.

12:56.629 --> 12:58.109
If it really comes to it,

12:58.229 --> 13:00.390
I'll ask my parents to come over.

13:00.390 --> 13:01.900
We can cook together as one big family.

13:01.950 --> 13:03.070
That'll save a lot.

13:11.910 --> 13:12.589
Fei Ni.

13:14.404 --> 13:16.093
I'm sorry you have to go through this.

13:20.229 --> 13:22.070
We're family.

13:22.589 --> 13:24.109
Don't say that.

13:27.150 --> 13:27.869
Besides,

13:28.100 --> 13:30.404
it was your support
that helped me get into university.

13:30.648 --> 13:32.560
Let's hang in there together
a little longer.

13:37.382 --> 13:38.340
Let's make the bed.

14:08.247 --> 14:13.229
(Jiangcheng City Educated Youth Office)

14:13.229 --> 14:13.869
Mr. Gao.

14:15.070 --> 14:15.629
Fang,

14:16.070 --> 14:17.190
I was just looking for you.

14:18.270 --> 14:19.469
Is there news about a job?

14:20.070 --> 14:20.869
Well.

14:21.430 --> 14:24.310
There's an opening
for a restaurant waiter.

14:24.550 --> 14:25.560
Would you like to try?

14:25.589 --> 14:26.229
Yes.

14:27.190 --> 14:28.070
But

14:28.190 --> 14:29.749
you'll have to pass

14:30.030 --> 14:31.550
their interview first.

14:32.270 --> 14:33.070
That's fine.

14:35.047 --> 14:35.926
Fang,

14:36.072 --> 14:37.660
I've read your file.

14:38.490 --> 14:39.010
I found that

14:39.010 --> 14:40.650
you were a hero who saved someone.

14:41.270 --> 14:42.869
But you may not know much

14:42.869 --> 14:44.070
about Deda Restaurant.

14:44.430 --> 14:44.910
Well,

14:44.910 --> 14:46.550
let me introduce you...

14:46.550 --> 14:48.048
I actually know it quite well.

14:48.220 --> 14:50.893
Sir, I think the restaurant served
the best fried pork chop.

14:50.960 --> 14:52.430
The heat is just right.

14:52.670 --> 14:53.509
It's nice and crispy.

14:53.509 --> 14:55.229
The ice cream has a great texture too.

14:55.390 --> 14:57.048
But the borscht is a little bland.

14:57.137 --> 14:58.760
Maybe add half a tomato more.

14:58.848 --> 15:00.270
And when you pan-fry the steak,

15:00.270 --> 15:01.869
you could use more rosemary and thyme.

15:01.869 --> 15:02.950
It'll taste richer.

15:02.950 --> 15:04.550
The bread selection here

15:04.550 --> 15:05.390
is impressive.

15:05.390 --> 15:06.109
Sliced baguette,

15:06.109 --> 15:06.829
dinner rolls,

15:06.829 --> 15:08.550
buttered toast, we've got everything.

15:08.648 --> 15:09.804
And they all taste great.

15:11.390 --> 15:13.190
I can tell you did your research.

15:13.922 --> 15:14.723
Comrade Fang Muyang,

15:15.589 --> 15:16.469
welcome abroad.

15:17.950 --> 15:18.749
Thank you,

15:18.950 --> 15:20.070
Manager.

15:24.629 --> 15:25.989
Here's your water.

15:26.550 --> 15:27.190
Ma'am,

15:28.550 --> 15:30.469
are you satisfied with my service?

15:31.829 --> 15:32.629
Yes.

15:33.070 --> 15:34.670
What would you like to order today?

15:35.390 --> 15:37.229
Our signature is fried pork chop.

15:38.404 --> 15:39.604
The ice cream is good too.

15:39.610 --> 15:40.709
And we have various breads...

15:40.709 --> 15:41.390
Fang Muyang,

15:42.172 --> 15:45.015
are you thinking about
going to Deda Restaurant again?

15:45.229 --> 15:46.229
To be precise,

15:46.670 --> 15:47.670
starting tomorrow,

15:47.980 --> 15:50.271
I'll be going to Deda Western Restaurant
every day.

15:52.430 --> 15:53.390
You found a job?

15:53.670 --> 15:54.030
Yes.

15:55.469 --> 15:56.989
But you can't cook.

15:58.550 --> 15:59.869
I'm a waiter.

16:03.204 --> 16:05.100
One of the waiters
at Deda Western Restaurant

16:05.270 --> 16:06.390
got bacterial dysentery

16:06.589 --> 16:07.589
and can't work,

16:07.989 --> 16:09.229
so there's an opening.

16:09.604 --> 16:11.115
Or I wouldn't have gotten in.

16:11.709 --> 16:12.910
And I think

16:13.550 --> 16:14.509
working in a restaurant

16:14.709 --> 16:16.589
lets me meet all kinds of people.

16:17.030 --> 16:18.670
It'll help with my creation.

16:22.430 --> 16:24.509
You draw for the newspaper.

16:24.829 --> 16:26.430
Are you sure

16:27.910 --> 16:29.115
you can handle being a waiter?

16:30.070 --> 16:31.150
Of course.

16:31.869 --> 16:34.229
The moment I step into
Deda Western Restaurant,

16:34.869 --> 16:36.349
it feels like home.

16:36.349 --> 16:37.229
I'm totally at ease.

16:37.670 --> 16:38.550
And let me tell you,

16:39.030 --> 16:40.390
not just anyone

16:40.589 --> 16:42.030
can be a waiter there.

16:42.589 --> 16:44.109
They do background checks,

16:44.226 --> 16:45.715
you have to know the menu inside out,

16:45.848 --> 16:47.150
and you need to look presentable.

16:47.430 --> 16:48.629
I went through a lot

16:48.629 --> 16:49.950
to get this job.

16:53.910 --> 16:54.469
Fei Ni,

16:55.670 --> 16:57.030
my salary isn't high,

16:57.829 --> 16:59.349
but I can work harder

16:59.550 --> 17:00.670
and take on extra jobs.

17:01.550 --> 17:02.950
I can support the family.

17:05.069 --> 17:05.870
Then you

17:06.910 --> 17:08.509
can go to university without worries.

17:11.870 --> 17:12.509
Okay.

17:13.069 --> 17:14.430
Alright, I won't disturb you.

17:15.260 --> 17:16.293
Carry on with your study.

17:20.989 --> 17:22.350
Good evening, Sir.

17:22.910 --> 17:23.950
Good afternoon.

17:24.670 --> 17:25.749
Good afternoon.

17:27.069 --> 17:28.150
Wait. Wait.

17:30.549 --> 17:31.229
Which?

17:31.430 --> 17:32.190
What?

17:33.430 --> 17:34.190
Sir.

17:34.709 --> 17:36.190
Good evening.

17:44.229 --> 17:45.029
What's wrong?

17:49.670 --> 17:50.590
Nothing.

17:52.110 --> 17:53.390
I just wanted to hug you.

18:21.735 --> 18:23.812
The fridge is acting up again.

18:24.190 --> 18:26.285
The ice cream is going to melt.

18:29.069 --> 18:29.630
Ms. Xu.

18:29.630 --> 18:30.190
Yes?

18:30.190 --> 18:30.950
What's it?

18:31.670 --> 18:32.989
The fridge is broken again.

18:33.069 --> 18:34.910
If we leave it overnight after closing,

18:34.910 --> 18:36.150
it'll all go bad.

18:37.350 --> 18:38.269
What do we do?

18:38.469 --> 18:39.590
What else?

18:39.590 --> 18:41.830
Throw it away.
There isn't much left anyway.

18:42.910 --> 18:43.749
Don't throw it away.

18:44.390 --> 18:45.509
That's such a waste.

18:46.029 --> 18:46.870
Why not give it to me?

18:47.430 --> 18:48.390
Count it

18:48.390 --> 18:50.150
as saving a bit of loss for the country.

18:50.870 --> 18:51.547
Ms. Xu,

18:51.789 --> 18:52.950
leave some for me too.

18:54.670 --> 18:55.950
You two little gluttons.

18:56.110 --> 18:56.950
Take it.

18:57.048 --> 18:57.893
Thank you, Ms. Xu.

18:57.900 --> 18:59.150
- No problem.
- Thank you, Ms. Xu.

18:59.150 --> 19:00.622
I'll ask Mr. Zhang
to fix the fridge.

19:01.630 --> 19:02.549
I'll get the lunch box.

19:11.610 --> 19:13.485
(The Masses Have Boundless Creativity)

19:13.510 --> 19:16.710
(The Chinese Communist Party is the
Core Leadership of the Chinese People)

19:20.870 --> 19:21.590
Quick.

19:21.590 --> 19:22.309
What's wrong?

19:23.204 --> 19:24.590
Why are you being so mysterious?

19:24.590 --> 19:25.670
I brought you ice cream.

19:25.830 --> 19:26.590
Ice cream?

19:26.590 --> 19:27.069
Yes.

19:32.350 --> 19:33.150
It melted.

19:34.469 --> 19:36.150
It's okay. Let me taste it.

19:38.870 --> 19:39.830
Do you want a spoon?

19:40.549 --> 19:41.029
No need.

19:43.269 --> 19:44.110
It's so sweet.

19:44.709 --> 19:46.069
It's sweeter when melted.

19:46.269 --> 19:46.670
Really?

19:48.830 --> 19:49.269
Try it.

19:57.271 --> 19:58.350
You're making such a mess.

20:40.789 --> 20:41.309
Ling Yi.

20:42.749 --> 20:43.509
Chen.

20:46.789 --> 20:47.229
Ling Yi,

20:47.749 --> 20:49.029
I came specifically to see you.

20:51.870 --> 20:52.749
This is for you.

20:56.469 --> 20:58.190
You gave me so many things last time.

20:58.630 --> 20:59.830
I should return the favor.

21:00.229 --> 21:01.430
I hope you write

21:01.590 --> 21:02.830
even better articles.

21:06.870 --> 21:07.693
Don't worry.

21:08.150 --> 21:09.110
I've been looking into

21:09.709 --> 21:10.749
Ye Feng's job situation.

21:12.350 --> 21:13.029
But you know

21:13.430 --> 21:14.830
finance work is...

21:14.980 --> 21:16.182
That's not necessary, Chen.

21:17.190 --> 21:17.989
What's wrong?

21:19.122 --> 21:19.910
Nothing.

21:20.390 --> 21:21.229
He's...

21:24.430 --> 21:25.469
past help.

21:29.360 --> 21:31.382
I didn't expect Ye Feng
to be this kind of person.

21:32.830 --> 21:33.870
I don't blame anyone.

21:34.335 --> 21:35.855
I only blame myself for misjudging him.

21:38.229 --> 21:40.269
You can choose again then.

21:42.789 --> 21:43.469
Ling Yi,

21:44.430 --> 21:45.630
a lady as good as you,

21:46.590 --> 21:47.709
shouldn't waste her life

21:47.709 --> 21:48.870
on someone like that.

21:50.226 --> 21:51.670
It pains me when I hear about it.

21:59.747 --> 22:00.787
Do you have class later?

22:09.670 --> 22:10.910
Let me take you to a movie.

22:11.630 --> 22:12.390
Clear your head.

22:25.670 --> 22:26.190
Let's go.

22:28.549 --> 22:29.350
Hello.

22:29.950 --> 22:30.830
Are you still open?

22:31.350 --> 22:32.190
We're closed.

22:32.190 --> 22:33.340
You can come early tomorrow.

22:34.110 --> 22:34.590
You see,

22:34.989 --> 22:36.789
I need to catch a train later.

22:37.390 --> 22:38.749
Could you do me a favor?

22:38.893 --> 22:40.115
What do you want to buy?

22:40.190 --> 22:42.269
Just some pastries.

22:43.471 --> 22:44.960
Alright. You can leave first.

22:45.048 --> 22:46.540
I'm waiting for my husband anyway.

22:46.549 --> 22:47.539
I'll get them for him.

22:47.540 --> 22:48.570
Alright. I'm leaving then.

22:48.582 --> 22:49.093
Thank you.

22:49.137 --> 22:49.870
No problem.

22:51.549 --> 22:52.709
What would you like?

22:55.749 --> 22:57.190
Some fried rice sticks,

22:58.950 --> 22:59.749
royal jelly,

23:01.989 --> 23:03.670
and some walnut cookies too.

23:03.749 --> 23:04.150
Sure.

23:04.150 --> 23:05.040
And the small cookies.

23:05.590 --> 23:06.670
Here you go.

23:06.749 --> 23:07.709
Thank you.

23:08.430 --> 23:09.110
Careful.

23:12.549 --> 23:13.390
Let's go, Lin Mei.

23:15.789 --> 23:17.469
It's Mom's birthday.

23:17.469 --> 23:19.709
What should we get her?

23:19.950 --> 23:21.309
I've already prepared it.

23:21.989 --> 23:22.590
What is it?

23:22.590 --> 23:23.390
Look.

23:24.950 --> 23:26.310
You're always so thoughtful.

23:26.870 --> 23:27.469
Let's go.

23:28.509 --> 23:29.309
What's this?

23:30.709 --> 23:31.390
Oh, no.

23:32.309 --> 23:32.749
What?

23:32.749 --> 23:33.989
That customer from earlier.

23:34.070 --> 23:35.382
(Hongxing Supply Cooperative)
Mister!

23:42.190 --> 23:42.950
Where is he?

23:43.950 --> 23:44.549
Who?

23:45.309 --> 23:45.830
I told you.

23:45.830 --> 23:47.549
The customer who just bought things.

23:48.069 --> 23:49.069
He left quickly.

23:49.410 --> 23:51.069
(To Serve the People)

23:51.069 --> 23:51.950
What do I do?

23:52.469 --> 23:54.509
Check what's in the bag.

24:00.060 --> 24:01.860
(To Serve the People)

24:02.469 --> 24:03.190
So much money.

24:04.950 --> 24:05.469
This...

24:05.870 --> 24:06.749
What do we do?

24:06.870 --> 24:07.604
Hand it over.

24:07.782 --> 24:08.982
Hand it over to your superior.

24:09.190 --> 24:09.709
Alright.

24:10.749 --> 24:11.229
No.

24:11.709 --> 24:13.110
They've all gone home.

24:13.390 --> 24:13.910
And

24:14.382 --> 24:15.648
if I keep this much money,

24:15.715 --> 24:17.500
what if someone accuses me
of taking it?

24:17.549 --> 24:18.910
Who would believe me?

24:19.670 --> 24:21.110
I don't trust handing it to anyone.

24:23.150 --> 24:23.870
Then what?

24:26.670 --> 24:27.229
Maybe

24:27.630 --> 24:28.870
I'll keep it safe for him.

24:29.350 --> 24:30.549
When he comes back,

24:30.549 --> 24:31.950
I'll return it exactly as it is.

24:36.950 --> 24:37.350
Alright.

24:38.150 --> 24:38.870
Let's go back

24:38.870 --> 24:40.293
and celebrate Mom's birthday first.

24:40.390 --> 24:41.069
Alright.

24:41.670 --> 24:43.648
(To Serve the People)
Wait. I forgot the things.

24:43.789 --> 24:44.590
I need to lock up.

24:51.190 --> 24:51.910
Mom,

24:52.260 --> 24:54.915
it's not that I'm eyeing your money.
It's a rare opportunity.

24:55.204 --> 24:57.700
Just 400 yuan. With that, I can
buy a bike, a sewing machine,

24:58.390 --> 24:59.150
and a watch.

24:59.404 --> 25:00.915
I don't even need to buy a radio.

25:00.920 --> 25:02.460
Then I can get into the transport team.

25:02.469 --> 25:03.950
It's a great opportunity.

25:04.789 --> 25:05.670
That's right, Mom.

25:05.670 --> 25:06.269
You see,

25:06.549 --> 25:08.390
once Lin Song gets into
the transport team,

25:08.749 --> 25:10.590
we'll definitely take good care
of you and Dad.

25:10.590 --> 25:11.229
Right.

25:11.670 --> 25:13.789
He'll drive big trucks
all over the country

25:13.789 --> 25:15.509
and bring all the good things home.

25:15.509 --> 25:16.309
Exactly.

25:16.549 --> 25:17.350
Enough.

25:17.590 --> 25:20.539
How much money have you taken from me

25:20.540 --> 25:22.093
all these years trying to switch jobs?

25:23.190 --> 25:24.430
It all went down the drain.

25:25.309 --> 25:26.390
Did you ever get a job?

25:26.789 --> 25:27.269
Mom,

25:27.910 --> 25:29.309
this time, it's real.

25:29.309 --> 25:31.350
Real or not,

25:31.390 --> 25:32.870
I don't have money.

25:39.910 --> 25:41.350
So you won't pay

25:41.350 --> 25:42.709
for your own son?

25:44.026 --> 25:45.110
If you weren't going to pay,

25:45.110 --> 25:46.572
why didn't you marry Lin Mei off

25:46.572 --> 25:47.812
to Wang Tengda?

25:48.069 --> 25:49.630
If he were my brother-in-law now,

25:49.630 --> 25:51.100
I'd already be in the transport team.

25:51.115 --> 25:52.150
I could've done anything.

25:52.150 --> 25:53.950
I'd be way better
than that useless Fei Ting.

25:56.950 --> 25:57.430
Well,

25:58.309 --> 26:00.469
let Fei Ting and Lin Mei divorce.

26:00.870 --> 26:01.830
Nonsense!

26:03.910 --> 26:05.150
What nonsense are you spouting?

26:05.749 --> 26:07.110
You want your sister to divorce?

26:07.469 --> 26:07.989
Fine.

26:08.309 --> 26:09.749
They're coming later.

26:10.029 --> 26:11.469
Say it to her face.

26:11.549 --> 26:12.870
You ungrateful rascal!

26:13.950 --> 26:14.870
You're insane.

26:14.950 --> 26:15.469
Dad.

26:15.590 --> 26:16.110
Dad.

26:16.120 --> 26:18.370
The kid's playing outside.
Aren't you afraid he'll get lost?

26:18.382 --> 26:18.850
Go find him.

26:18.910 --> 26:20.350
Why are you taking it out on me?

26:21.469 --> 26:22.150
Aihong.

26:23.069 --> 26:23.670
Jianshe!

26:24.870 --> 26:25.430
Jianshe!

26:32.150 --> 26:32.950
Mom,

26:33.630 --> 26:34.350
what's wrong?

26:34.910 --> 26:36.469
I saw Dad and Aihong...

26:36.469 --> 26:38.269
If you're back, go cook now.

26:38.749 --> 26:39.670
We're all waiting.

26:46.309 --> 26:47.269
I'll cook.

26:47.749 --> 26:49.150
Did he make you angry again?

26:49.309 --> 26:50.269
Don't mention him.

26:51.309 --> 26:52.350
Alright, Mom.

26:52.549 --> 26:53.309
Don't be upset.

26:53.549 --> 26:54.709
It's your birthday.

26:54.950 --> 26:55.549
Look,

26:55.749 --> 26:57.110
we bought you a gift.

26:57.110 --> 26:57.910
It's pretty.

26:58.630 --> 26:59.749
Look at the pattern.

27:00.460 --> 27:01.248
Do you like it?

27:04.048 --> 27:04.630
Don't be upset.

27:04.760 --> 27:06.048
Daughters are always the best.

27:26.509 --> 27:26.910
Mei,

27:26.910 --> 27:28.630
what are you rummaging for?

27:31.190 --> 27:31.749
I...

27:31.749 --> 27:33.749
I'm looking for

27:33.915 --> 27:36.493
the letters Fei Ting wrote me
from Great Northern Wilderness.

27:36.648 --> 27:38.060
Why dig up that?

27:38.069 --> 27:39.422
It was a long time ago.

27:59.110 --> 28:01.235
Mom, I'll go help Fei Ting cook.

28:04.509 --> 28:06.110
Such a pity about this glass.

28:15.390 --> 28:18.110
36, 37, 38, 39...

28:19.749 --> 28:20.630
What are you doing?

28:21.509 --> 28:23.269
Lin Mei, where did you get
so much money?

28:23.509 --> 28:24.390
None of your business.

28:24.830 --> 28:26.309
Lin Mei, you've got that much.

28:26.309 --> 28:27.910
Lend your brother 400 yuan.

28:27.950 --> 28:28.509
Mom,

28:28.749 --> 28:30.069
it's not mine.

28:30.069 --> 28:31.709
A customer left it at the store.

28:31.780 --> 28:32.448
Give it to me.

28:32.549 --> 28:33.870
It's not yours anyway.

28:33.870 --> 28:35.115
All the more reason to lend it.

28:35.226 --> 28:36.540
He'll come back for it.

28:36.549 --> 28:38.190
I have to return it. Give it to me.

28:38.190 --> 28:40.269
I'll figure something out later
and pay you back.

28:40.870 --> 28:41.937
What will you figure out?

28:42.050 --> 28:43.830
You'll just shrug and say
you have no money.

28:43.830 --> 28:45.110
What about me? Give it to me.

28:46.110 --> 28:47.150
Lin Mei,

28:47.509 --> 28:49.029
it's my birthday.

28:49.069 --> 28:50.309
This is my only wish.

28:50.309 --> 28:51.590
Just give us the money. Please.

28:51.590 --> 28:52.229
Mom,

28:52.469 --> 28:53.549
I can't.

28:53.749 --> 28:54.749
Give it to me!

28:55.830 --> 28:56.709
Don't grab it!

28:57.229 --> 28:57.709
Lin Mei.

28:57.789 --> 28:59.029
Just lend it to him, Lin Mei.

28:59.029 --> 28:59.509
Give it back!

28:59.509 --> 29:00.989
He used to give you money
when you were kids.

29:00.989 --> 29:02.350
Fei Ting!

29:02.350 --> 29:03.190
He'll pay you back.

29:03.190 --> 29:03.870
Give it to me!

29:03.870 --> 29:04.670
Fei Ting!

29:05.430 --> 29:06.430
What are you doing?

29:09.509 --> 29:10.069
Let go!

29:24.910 --> 29:25.390
Lin Mei,

29:25.870 --> 29:26.509
let's go home.

29:42.071 --> 29:43.110
You protect the money.

29:43.229 --> 29:44.029
I'll protect you.

29:44.110 --> 29:45.604
We'll wait for the owner to come back.

29:56.670 --> 29:57.350
Mom.

29:58.110 --> 29:58.870
You're home.

29:59.390 --> 30:00.350
Have you eaten?

30:00.549 --> 30:01.190
I'm not hungry.

30:01.789 --> 30:02.709
Where's Ye Feng?

30:04.430 --> 30:05.069
Ye Feng

30:05.182 --> 30:06.737
is working overtime at the canteen.

30:07.515 --> 30:09.260
What kind of overtime
does a canteen have?

30:09.269 --> 30:11.110
Mom, please don't lie to me.

30:11.229 --> 30:12.709
Did he go play basketball again?

30:13.630 --> 30:14.709
No.

30:14.709 --> 30:16.950
He gave us his word.

30:16.950 --> 30:18.029
He wouldn't go anymore.

30:19.029 --> 30:19.950
I'm home.

30:21.029 --> 30:21.469
Mom,

30:21.469 --> 30:23.269
I'm going to take a shower. It's hot.

30:39.509 --> 30:40.229
Ye Feng,

30:40.430 --> 30:41.350
let's talk.

30:42.670 --> 30:43.509
What is it?

30:46.630 --> 30:48.749
When I was little,
I had a wonderful life.

30:49.229 --> 30:50.749
My dad worked at the Textile Bureau,

30:50.749 --> 30:51.870
and my mom at a distillery.

30:52.350 --> 30:53.670
They adored me.

30:54.670 --> 30:56.071
No matter what trouble I got into,

30:56.093 --> 30:57.204
they always stood up for me.

30:58.430 --> 30:59.229
Back then,

30:59.590 --> 31:01.390
I thought they'd be my support for life.

31:03.069 --> 31:04.709
You told me all this before.

31:06.709 --> 31:08.110
But when I was twelve,

31:08.549 --> 31:09.749
they divorced.

31:10.549 --> 31:12.509
I never saw my dad again.

31:13.950 --> 31:15.269
After my mom passed away,

31:15.310 --> 31:17.382
I was sent to the production team
in the Northeast.

31:17.430 --> 31:19.560
I was assigned to the same station
as Fang Muyang.

31:21.150 --> 31:22.630
He took good care of me.

31:23.469 --> 31:24.870
I thought I could rely on him.

31:25.893 --> 31:28.430
Later, I was recommended for university
and returned to the city.

31:28.549 --> 31:29.709
That's when I met you.

31:30.182 --> 31:31.910
Your mom was
the factory office director.

31:31.950 --> 31:33.693
You were the captain
of the basketball team.

31:33.960 --> 31:36.110
I thought I could rely on you
for the rest of my life.

31:36.870 --> 31:38.350
What are you getting at?

31:41.149 --> 31:42.390
Do you know the trumpet vine?

31:45.029 --> 31:46.229
It's a climbing plant.

31:46.670 --> 31:48.989
It only feels secure
when it clings to a big tree.

31:49.469 --> 31:50.029
Ye Feng,

31:50.870 --> 31:52.950
I'm not asking you
to grow into a big tree.

31:53.350 --> 31:54.709
But at least be a sturdy post

31:54.709 --> 31:56.110
that I can lean on.

31:57.670 --> 31:58.509
Promise me

31:59.110 --> 32:01.069
you'll study those accounting books.

32:03.110 --> 32:04.709
I'll get someone to fix your abacus.

32:04.870 --> 32:05.709
Alright?

32:05.709 --> 32:06.269
Seriously?

32:07.709 --> 32:09.350
After all that,

32:09.426 --> 32:11.471
you're still trying to make me
study accounting?

32:13.910 --> 32:15.709
I've made myself clear.

32:15.709 --> 32:16.830
I can't learn it,

32:16.830 --> 32:19.110
and I don't want to.

32:20.469 --> 32:22.110
Forget it. I'm going to shower.

32:36.535 --> 32:39.950
(Education Must Be Combined
with Productive Labor)

32:39.950 --> 32:40.950
Look at this part

32:40.950 --> 32:41.910
and this part.

32:42.110 --> 32:43.309
You can study them carefully.

32:43.469 --> 32:45.110
It'll definitely help you.

32:45.150 --> 32:46.830
I will.

32:47.671 --> 32:50.110
If there's anything I don't understand,
I'll come ask you.

32:50.150 --> 32:51.229
Thank you, Ms. Mu.

32:52.630 --> 32:54.229
I haven't been reinstated yet.

32:54.540 --> 32:55.871
Please don't call me that yet.

32:56.293 --> 32:57.782
Isn't that just a matter of time?

32:58.150 --> 32:59.590
Our department can't do without you.

33:01.670 --> 33:03.469
Have you passed on

33:03.469 --> 33:04.670
those brilliant genes of yours?

33:04.670 --> 33:06.950
The country needs more math talent.

33:15.309 --> 33:16.150
My son

33:16.150 --> 33:17.630
takes after his father. He paints.

33:17.910 --> 33:19.350
Painting's good, too.

33:19.789 --> 33:21.430
Ms. Mu, I won't keep you any longer.

33:21.430 --> 33:22.029
Thank you.

33:23.672 --> 33:27.147
(No. 44 Kangnan Road)

34:15.230 --> 34:16.029
Mujing?

34:27.790 --> 34:28.430
Dad.

34:38.669 --> 34:40.029
Why are you only coming home now?

34:43.509 --> 34:44.710
Let's go home.

34:46.069 --> 34:46.870
Ms. Fang.

34:56.029 --> 34:57.149
What are you doing here?

34:58.629 --> 34:59.469
Mu,

35:00.469 --> 35:01.710
Mujing is back.

35:02.285 --> 35:03.886
It's Ms. Fang Mujing.

35:04.149 --> 35:05.870
Our daughter, Fang Mujing.

35:05.870 --> 35:06.629
Fang Qingyuan,

35:07.029 --> 35:09.147
she has cut ties with you.

35:10.710 --> 35:11.910
Who do you think you are?

35:13.189 --> 35:14.629
How can you call yourself her father?

35:15.549 --> 35:16.989
You'd better not ruin her future.

35:24.430 --> 35:25.230
Ms. Fang,

35:26.469 --> 35:28.230
my husband comes from a bad background.

35:28.715 --> 35:30.010
He's not worthy to speak to you.

35:31.350 --> 35:31.710
Let's go.

35:58.950 --> 36:01.270
You've been coming home
later and later.

36:01.469 --> 36:02.750
You're busier than a doctor.

36:03.109 --> 36:04.950
If you're late again,

36:05.100 --> 36:06.071
I'll come pick you up...

36:13.910 --> 36:14.830
What's wrong?

36:20.710 --> 36:21.669
Did someone bully you?

36:31.335 --> 36:32.347
There, there.

36:53.990 --> 36:55.204
(No. 44 Kangnan Road)

37:06.029 --> 37:06.549
Excuse me.

37:07.950 --> 37:10.109
Does Fang Muyang live here?

37:10.549 --> 37:11.910
Yes.

37:11.910 --> 37:12.910
And you are?

37:13.549 --> 37:15.950
I'm his brother-in-law, Qu Hua.

37:17.910 --> 37:19.149
Mujing's husband?

37:20.109 --> 37:20.629
Yes.

37:22.870 --> 37:23.870
I'm her father.

37:26.870 --> 37:27.350
Dad.

37:28.989 --> 37:30.069
Come.

37:30.069 --> 37:31.750
Let's go upstairs.

37:34.109 --> 37:36.549
I've long heard my son-in-law
is a decent man.

37:36.950 --> 37:39.430
I finally saw it for myself today.

37:39.750 --> 37:40.830
Have some water.

37:40.830 --> 37:41.310
Thank you.

37:47.750 --> 37:48.549
Dad,

37:49.310 --> 37:52.029
I'd like to bring Mujing home
for a meal sometime.

37:52.270 --> 37:53.069
Of course.

37:53.350 --> 37:54.669
You're always welcome.

37:55.750 --> 37:58.310
Would Mom welcome us too?

38:03.430 --> 38:04.870
Your mom, well...

38:10.549 --> 38:10.989
Mu,

38:11.910 --> 38:12.910
this is Qu Hua.

38:14.669 --> 38:15.549
Mujing's husband.

38:17.230 --> 38:17.910
Mom,

38:18.430 --> 38:20.270
I'm Mujing's husband, Qu Hua.

38:21.230 --> 38:22.910
We met on campus before.

38:23.870 --> 38:26.830
I never had the chance
to properly visit you and Dad,

38:26.950 --> 38:28.270
so I came today.

38:29.549 --> 38:31.029
What is Ms. Fang's husband

38:31.830 --> 38:33.350
here for?

38:39.910 --> 38:40.790
Mom, I brought...

38:40.790 --> 38:41.509
Dr. Qu,

38:42.750 --> 38:44.589
Ms. Fang has nothing to do with us.

38:45.350 --> 38:46.350
Don't get it wrong.

38:49.830 --> 38:52.335
Fang, I brought some good
from the cafeteria.

38:52.629 --> 38:53.950
Heat it up.

39:08.069 --> 39:08.830
Qu Hua,

39:10.109 --> 39:11.069
you should go home.

39:12.910 --> 39:14.710
This will take time.

39:16.937 --> 39:18.315
I don't want Mujing to be upset.

39:18.471 --> 39:19.540
This can't be dragged out.

39:25.830 --> 39:28.230
Mom, I want to talk to you.

39:31.710 --> 39:32.350
Mom.

39:32.910 --> 39:33.629
Mom.

39:34.310 --> 39:35.710
Mom, can we talk face-to-face?

39:36.109 --> 39:37.029
Please open the door.

39:53.910 --> 39:54.870
You're back.

39:56.950 --> 39:58.149
I forgot to get food.

39:58.629 --> 39:59.830
I went to your house today.

40:07.830 --> 40:08.629
Kangnan Road.

40:16.270 --> 40:17.549
That's not my home anymore.

40:19.149 --> 40:19.950
Says who?

40:21.549 --> 40:22.629
Your dad said

40:22.737 --> 40:24.871
you should come back for dinner
when you have time.

40:30.029 --> 40:30.830
What about my mom?

40:38.310 --> 40:39.270
She probably

40:39.910 --> 40:41.310
needs some time.

40:52.109 --> 40:52.669
Mujing,

40:53.629 --> 40:54.390
why don't you

40:55.750 --> 40:56.910
be brave one more time?

40:58.549 --> 41:01.669
Try to accept them

41:02.337 --> 41:03.715
as when you chose to leave them.

41:12.910 --> 41:13.750
Mujing,

41:15.390 --> 41:16.750
you'll have to stitch up

41:17.069 --> 41:18.549
the wound yourself.

41:25.946 --> 41:28.140
(No. 44 Kangnan Road)

41:28.230 --> 41:28.870
Fei Ni,

41:29.272 --> 41:30.112
I got my pay.

41:30.910 --> 41:31.629
Really?

41:31.750 --> 41:32.469
Great.

41:33.397 --> 41:34.797
Let's buy something for everyone.

41:35.029 --> 41:35.669
Sure.

41:36.293 --> 41:37.471
What do you want to get?

41:38.230 --> 41:40.390
Imagine if we had more money
than we could ever spend.

41:41.069 --> 41:42.029
We'd buy whatever

41:42.029 --> 41:44.197
we wanted.

41:44.271 --> 41:45.310
What else would you want?

41:45.750 --> 41:47.069
I'd

41:48.390 --> 41:51.830
buy you a hat.

41:52.069 --> 41:52.750
A hat?

41:52.750 --> 41:53.710
A hat.

41:53.710 --> 41:54.549
For winter?

41:54.549 --> 41:56.109
Of course, for winter.

41:56.469 --> 41:57.549
That'll be a Leifeng Hat.

41:57.549 --> 41:58.270
Leifeng Hat.

41:59.310 --> 42:00.539
And a pair of gloves.

42:00.540 --> 42:01.293
Gloves.

42:01.300 --> 42:02.910
Your hands freeze
when you ride your bike.

42:02.910 --> 42:04.350
The kind you can hang around your neck.

42:04.350 --> 42:04.659
Yes.

42:04.660 --> 42:06.315
- With a string in the middle.
- Right.

42:08.629 --> 42:09.270
For my mom,

42:09.270 --> 42:11.029
I'd buy a pair of glasses.
Reading glasses.

42:11.029 --> 42:12.230
A pair of reading glasses.

42:12.230 --> 42:12.710
Yes.

42:12.989 --> 42:13.710
And your dad?

42:14.950 --> 42:15.910
As for him...

42:15.910 --> 42:16.509
Liquor.

42:16.509 --> 42:18.029
Liquor, of course.

42:18.029 --> 42:19.270
A big jar of it.

42:19.270 --> 42:20.069
A huge jar.

42:24.750 --> 42:27.149
We'll buy a big table for your dad.

42:27.149 --> 42:28.669
Yes, a table.

42:29.310 --> 42:29.950
With eight legs.

42:30.069 --> 42:30.710
Eight legs.

42:30.710 --> 42:31.830
Eight legs are good, right?

42:33.149 --> 42:34.589
It's very long and very wide.

42:34.589 --> 42:36.950
Six meters long, and two meters wide.

42:36.950 --> 42:37.629
Okay.

42:38.149 --> 42:40.671
And paper, ink, brushes,
and an inkstone.

42:43.069 --> 42:44.910
I've decided what to get
for your mom.

42:45.109 --> 42:46.335
I'll draw it, and you guess.

42:47.149 --> 42:48.149
A bookshelf?

42:48.310 --> 42:48.910
Yes.

42:48.989 --> 42:50.549
- A big bookshelf.
- A big bookshelf.

43:28.860 --> 43:33.340
♪After the laughter, I think of you♪

43:35.900 --> 43:40.620
♪After the storm, I think of you♪

43:43.140 --> 43:49.260
♪In the little courtyard,
there you are dancing♪

43:50.260 --> 43:54.820
♪That earnest you,
smiling so innocently♪

43:57.300 --> 44:02.060
♪In spring, I stay by your side♪

44:04.500 --> 44:08.860
♪When summer comes, I watch over you♪

44:11.220 --> 44:17.860
♪In the light of dawn, you belong to me♪

44:17.860 --> 44:27.460
♪At the edge of the world,
I will still hold you tight♪

44:28.540 --> 44:34.700
♪There is a small place♪

44:34.700 --> 44:41.500
♪Where they carry big dreams♪

44:41.500 --> 44:48.860
♪Every lovely face♪

44:49.740 --> 44:55.900
♪Shines brightly in the heart♪

44:56.700 --> 45:02.740
♪Even when we collide,
we hold our course♪

45:03.940 --> 45:09.740
♪Even when we stumble,
we keep our resolve♪

45:10.820 --> 45:17.100
♪My you, walking toward the distance♪

45:17.900 --> 45:26.140
♪Please carry our dreams
and let them soar♪
